# Seed package checklist for the Devario Community image repositories.
#
# This starts from the former install/runtime dependency closure of iso/packages.x86_64
# and every Devario package. It lets the image transaction use a hosted,
# self-contained package source without embedding repository archives in the ISO.
# Build-only dependencies are intentionally excluded. Regenerate this closure
# whenever repository snapshots or package dependencies change.
# scripts/audit-iso-repositories.py reports current resolution gaps; this list
# alone is not proof of dependency closure.

# Devario-owned package recipes
aqueous
aqueous-noctalia
aqueous-session
calamares
ckbcomp
devario-alpm-runtime
devario-aqueous-desktop
devario-base
devario-boot
devario-dracut
devario-filesystem
seafoam-keyring
devario-keyring
linux-cachyos-lts
linux-cachyos-lts-headers
